expression goes in parentheses and each case label ends with a colon.\" },\n172:     { q: \"Can a switch statement be nested inside another switch statement in C?\", correct: \"Yes\", wrongs: [\"No\", \"Only inside default\", \"Only with goto\"], explanation: \"Switch statements can be nested; each break only exits the innermost switch.\" }\n173:   ]\n174: };\n175: \n176: let db = null;\n177: try {\n178:   firebase.initializeApp(cfg);\n179:   db = firebase.firestore();\n180: } catch (e) {}","truncated_fields":["content"]}
