se 'a': printf(\"1\"); break;\n     case 'b': printf(\"2\");\n     case 'c': printf(\"3\"); break;\n   }\n   ```\n   * **Answer:** `23`\n\n10. **What happens if two case labels in the same switch have the same constant value?**\n    * **Answer:** Compile-time error\n\n11. **Where can the default label be placed inside a \n<truncated 8269 bytes>\nck `fetch('index.html')`), and trigger a file download named `index.html` with type `text/html`.\n      - Wire `save-btn.onclick` to save to Firestore `quizzes/{quizId}`, update template in `quizzes/template`, and show `Saved Successfully to Student Quiz File! Quiz is live.`.\n   2. In `HISTORY.md`:\n      - Append Non-Major Patch 1.0.9 detailing:\n        - Removed `defaultQuiz` from `firebase-config.js` and `teacher.html`.\n        - Replaced JSON download button with `Download QUIZ Json` downloading `index.html`.\n        - Updated Firestore write integration for updated security rules.\n   3. Verification:\n      - Run `node scratch/verify_code.mjs` to ensure 0 comments/docstrings in `teacher.html`, `index.html`, `firebase-config.js`, `vercel.json`.\n      - Run headless Edge on `teacher.html` and `index.html` to confirm clean DOM rendering and zero errors.\n\n7. **Commitments & Constraints**\n   - **Rule 1 (`HISTORY.md`):** Every non-major patch must be appended below current entries with explanation of why. Do not revise or update existing entries.\n   - **Rule 2 & 12:** Prohibited from touching original files other than UI (`QUIZ06 (1) (1).html` must stay untouched). Do not build APK.\n   - **Rule 9:** **ZERO IN-CODE DOCUMENTATION:** No comments (`//`, `/*`, `<!--`), docstrings, or TODO/FIXME in any source code.\n   - **Rule 6 & 8:** Explicit user approval required for new plans before modifying code (plan was approved with \"proceed\" in this session).\n</summary>\n\nYou have the 1 following artifacts written to the artifacts directory:\n\n[ARTIFACT: implementation_plan]\nPath: file:///C:/Users/CxAdmin/.gemini/antigr